# RFC-0024 five-candle-row performance parity

## Pre-work Plan

- 背景：Daedalus以Renderer `0.1.45`關閉OverviewStripe blocker，但真SPAA initial-run三次有兩次約220–226ms long task；owner 7-row／4,000-slot fixture無>100ms。
- 目標：以真SPAA等價的五個candlestick rows與4,000 slots重現並定位owner／consumer performance boundary。
- 假設：現有owner fixture只有price與Heikin candlestick-heavy rows，低估五列candlestick SVG mount／refresh成本。
- 步驟：盤點fixture與phase instrumentation；先擴owner fixture/gate；重跑F# Playwright；只有重現owner long task才修改Renderer bounded scheduling。
- 範圍：Renderer BrowserDemo、F# Playwright verifier、必要的Renderer scheduling與focused docs/tests；不改wire contract、consumer scenario semantics或效能門檻。
- 驗收：五個4,000-slot candlestick rows下initial/all/replacement各phase無>100ms，pointer p95<=50ms；若owner不重現，輸出可操作的consumer commit boundary evidence。
- 風險：單純複製row可能因dataRef共用而低估prepare成本；fixture須使用不同series/data refs並維持真SPAA row topology。

